@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title Vista de despliegue - Topología de KartRent (docker compose)

' Los nombres usan «guillemets» para que PlantUML no los interprete como estereotipos propios.
node "«device»\nSmartphone o PC del piloto" as DCLI #E3EEFF {
  node "«executionEnvironment»\nNavegador web" as NAV #FFFFFF {
    artifact "SPA React\n(dist/ servida por nginx)" as A_WEB #0FA394
  }
}
node "«device»\nTablet de boxes y taller" as DTAB #E3EEFF {
  node "«executionEnvironment»\nNavegador web" as NAV2 #FFFFFF {
    artifact "SPA React\n(Boxes, Taller)" as A_WEB2 #0FA394
  }
}
node "«device»\nPantalla de tiempos (sala)" as DTV #E3EEFF {
  node "«executionEnvironment»\nNavegador web" as NAV3 #FFFFFF {
    artifact "SPA React /en-vivo" as A_TV #0FA394
  }
}

node "«device»\nServidor Linux" as SRV #ECE8FF {
  node "«executionEnvironment»\nDocker Engine · docker compose" as DOCKER #F7F4FF {
    node "«executionEnvironment»\nContenedor frontend · nginx 1.27" as C_FE #FFFFFF {
      artifact "dist/ (SPA)" as A_DIST #0FA394
      artifact "nginx.conf\nproxy /api, /ws, /swagger-ui,\n/v3/api-docs, /actuator/health" as A_NGX #0FA394
    }
    node "«executionEnvironment»\nContenedor backend · JRE 21" as C_BE #DCD6FF {
      artifact "kartrent-backend.jar\nSpring Boot 3.3 · REST + STOMP" as A_API #0FA394
    }
    node "«executionEnvironment»\nContenedor db · PostgreSQL 16" as C_DB #DFF5F0 {
      database "kartrent\n(Flyway V1 a V5)" as A_DB
    }
  }
}

node "«device»\nDecodificador de meta\n(escenario hipotético)" as DDEC #FFF4D6 {
  artifact "envío de pasos\ndel transponder" as A_FW #0FA394
}
node "«sistema externo»\nPasarela de pagos real\n(escenario hipotético: Wompi o PayU)" as DPAS #F2F2F2

DCLI --> C_FE : HTTP :3000 → :80
DTAB --> C_FE : HTTP :3000 → :80
DTV --> C_FE : HTTP :3000 → :80\nWebSocket /ws (ws://)
C_FE --> C_BE : HTTP :8080\n(/api/v1, /ws con Upgrade)
C_BE --> C_DB : JDBC / TCP :5432
DDEC ..> C_FE : HTTP POST /api/v1/telemetria/pasos\n(usuario cronometraje)
C_BE ..> DPAS : HTTPS cobro y reembolso
DPAS ..> C_BE : webhook HMAC-SHA256 (X-Firma)

note bottom of C_BE
  En esta entrega la pasarela es PasarelaPagosSimulada,
  una clase dentro del backend: no sale ninguna llamada
  a internet. El decodificador lo imita la pantalla En vivo.
  Puertos publicados por docker compose: 3000 (nginx) y 8080 (backend).
  La base de datos solo es visible dentro de la red de compose.
end note
@enduml
